From: T S Rameshkumar <rameshkumar.t@phytecembedded.in>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 18:00:04 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 6/6] arm64: dts: freescale: Add PHYTEC phyGATE-Tauri-L device
 trees and interface overlays

Add base device tree for PHYTEC phyGATE-Tauri-L industrial IoT gateway based
on phyCORE-i.MX8MM. Provide device tree overlays for RS-232, RS-485, and
analog I/O expansion board configurations.

Signed-off-by: T S Rameshkumar <rameshkumar.t@phytecembedded.in>
